# Binaries
/trajan*
/bin/
*.exe

# Test artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.out
coverage*.out
coverage.html

# Docs
#
# docs/ is a scratch directory for research and planning notes, which stay
# local. The CLI-surface gate's artifacts are the exception: they are checked in
# and compared byte-for-byte in CI, so they are excluded at the content level
# (docs/*) rather than by directory -- git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is itself excluded, so a blanket "docs/" would make the negations
# below dead lines and the gate would fail forever on missing artifacts.
docs/*
!docs/CLI.md
!docs/cli-surface.json
!docs/cli-surface-allow.txt

